Wrong (A): GASB distinguishes between revenues (earned or imposed nonexchange transactions) and other financing sources (borrowings and transfers); bond proceeds are not revenue.
Wrong (C): Governmental funds use the current financial resources measurement focus and do not report long-term liabilities; that treatment appears only on government-wide statements.
